// ]]&gt;', 'Put that shit on cars not motorcycles! They are so much more dangerous!', 'Why are people complaining? Just because the government implements something doesn’t mean that its a bad thing – this will save so many lives!', 'It will cost lives when the motorcycle can’t get out of the way of the faster automobiles!', 'lol, what?? A car is doing 85, a MC is going to outrun it?? That makes sense! Seriously, sensible driving and riding is what saves or kills, most wrecks are from not paying attention and in the case of some riders, they have a BIG chip up there on their jacket and act like everyone is supposed to roll over for them. I can’t tell you how many Harley riders try to show me how fast they can take off when I come up beside them on my Honda VFR 800 crotch rocket!', 'Anna, I guess you don’t ride. Or maybe you’re just another liberal sheeple, who gets lead around by thier nose and agrees with everything.', 'Anna, I guess you don’t ride. But you’re a libtard who follows what others say.', 'I’m so flipping sick of people on motorcycles zooming down my street and weaving through traffic wherever I go! 75 is still too fast IMHO. I wish we could either ban motorcycles or make the people who drive them get “I’m a moron” tattooed on their forehead so we could avoid them even when they’re not causing chaos on the road.', 'What an extremely rude comment Michelle! Maybe we should ban people like you from posting on the internet or change your user name to” I’m a judgemental witch” so we can avoid you.', 'You’re a munch….   How about we ban the ability for you to shit out more than one child, as a percentage of children in society commit or participate crimes, murders, and other unwanted chaos  that cost society money and aggravate every day.   If you do have more than one child the law should mandate that you name the second, regardless of it’s sex, MORON.', 'STFU and go make me a sandwich.', 'We implemented something similar in Canada long ago…………welcome to civilization!', 'PFFHHHahahaha best satire comment yet', 'Yet another example of the U.S government attempting to parent its citizens. How is it that everybody forgets that politicians work for us – NOT the other way around.', 'More nanny state meddling!', 'If it were implemented, every biker I know (myself included) would either never get a governor installed or we’d disable it on bikes that had it.', 'This has GOT to be a joke, right? I simply refuse to believe people can be this flipping stupid. What next? Mandatory wearing of safety helmets for pedestrians? Governors on jet planes? Hey, it’s the speed that kills right? Not the crash! Better put some training wheels on those motorcycles next. Oh right… those 3 wheeled monstrosities. I’m in a freakin’ nightmare. Wake me up, please. Better yet, wake up these stupid SHEEP!', 'They should require operators of automobiles to pass safety training before issuing a license. More people are maimed and killed by automobiles. This is more of the government overstepping their authority.', 'Good luck on this. ..lol I won’t get one', 'So a BMW with 400+ hp that can go 155 mph is ok but a motorcycle that can go over 75 is oh-so-bad?? Who makes this crap up and why are they in a place of non-elected power where they can do these things?  Maybe they should limit automobiles to 100 hp and give them a top speed of 75. How well do you think that would go over despite the thousands of lives and billions of gallons of fuel it might save?  How about a mandatory governor on all bicycles, along with turn, tail, and headlights? Maybe we should ban all contact sports from high school level to the pro’s while we’re at it. And skateboards…is there anything more dangerous than those things for our children to operate? Where do we stop and why stop there? How much freedom are we willing to give away to be just a little safer each time a new fad idea like this pops up? ', 'You can’t legislate your way into a perfect Borg like world. Or is that the idea?', 'Tell these stupid people all bikers will do it right after all cars, trucks, semis, snowmobiles, quads, doonbuggys and I think even some fast lawnmowers. Mr law maker if you don’t ride, to stupid to learn stay out of our lives. If the cops aren’t doing there jobs and enforcing the speed limit why even have then on the road.', '

